su name features ob ve float32 1 2 be vector ya
su name weight one ob ve float32 1 2 be vector ya
su name weight two ob ve float32 2 1 be vector ya
su name weight three ob ve float32 3 0 be vector ya
exists su name candidate prediction via state "vector float32" by num 3 be variable ya
ob name features to name candidate prediction at num 0 by name weight one be kl6m psas do
ob name features to name candidate prediction at num 1 by name weight two be kl6m psas do
ob name features to name candidate prediction at num 2 by name weight three be kl6m psas do
su name candidate answer ob ve float32 5 4 3 be vector ya
ob name candidate prediction by name candidate answer to name num count be pluk tlas do
